WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.736
-Things are so depressing
that I want to thank you,

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:03.837 line:92%
because you come from Wisconsin,

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:05.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is known for
cheese and beer.

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:06.306 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:07.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes!
And a lot of other things.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And a lot of other things.
-[ Laughs ] Yes.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:11.745
-But you were kind enough
to actually bring beer.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
And while we're
talking about this,

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:15.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would much rather
have a beer out.

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:16.149 size:84% position:42% line:92%
So can we bring it out?

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:17.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Yeah. Okay, great.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.785
There we go.
This is -- Do you want to tell?

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, we don't have to pour it
in a glass, right?

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right, no.
-Okay, great. That's perfect.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, this is a famous beer?
-Yes, it is.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:28.928 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.964 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-That's a lot better.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.832 size:78% position:39% line:92%
That is a lot better.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.968 size:84% position:42%
You have an interesting
situation right now.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:38.538
You have a re-election campaign
coming up in the midterms.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:42.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
No candidate has had more
outside money spent

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
in order to defeat you
than you have.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.679
And you don't actually have
an opponent yet, correct?

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, the primary
hasn't happened yet.

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:49.883 line:92%
-The primaries haven't happened.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So they haven't nominated
an opponent.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.887
-So, they -- basically,
their problem is not that

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
they like the other person
more than you.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.123 line:92%
They just want to stop you.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:58.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think you're right. Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this is outside money
from billionaires.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.664 size:88% position:44%
How do you even approach
going into an election

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
knowing that you have so much
stacked up against you

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.101 line:92%
as far as outside interests?

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:11.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Well, I guess you would
have to choose --

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:13.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This helps, right?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:16.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I guess you have to
choose to sort of wear it

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:17.310 size:75% position:38% line:92%
as a badge of honor.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:21.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, these donors,
they have an agenda.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:24.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
They have --
They're special interests.

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:26.119 line:92%
And I don't think they like me.

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:30.423
And whether it's, you know,
Big Pharma that I'm fighting for

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:35.695
making sure that they don't jack
up the prices of drugs

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:38.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Wisconsinites
need to survive

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
or insurance companies
that are working with folks

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.336 line:92%
to try to get rid of coverage

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
for people with pre-existing
conditions.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:47.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or, you know, Wall Street
hedge funds

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.275 line:92%
that enjoy their tax loopholes.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.510 line:92%
I don't think they like me much

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:53.580 size:88% position:44%
because I'm fighting for
the people of Wisconsin

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:54.280 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and against them.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.782 line:92%
-I want to ask you about this.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:57.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
You had started politics
in your 20s.

00:01:57.851 --> 00:02:00.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were openly gay
for your first election.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:03.990
And now you are the first
openly gay senator elected.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-To the United States.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.060 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
-First woman too,
from Wisconsin.

00:02:08.862 --> 00:02:11.464
-Yep. First woman
from Wisconsin. A lot of firsts.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:15.435
And yet you said that was not as
much of a hurdle for voters

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:18.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
in your state
as you thought it would be.

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:20.707 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Is that true?

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:21.674 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-I think it is true.

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:25.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think that voters
are looking for somebody

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:27.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
who is in their corner,
who is listening.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:31.885
Listening is a key trait these
days that we don't see enough.

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:34.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think they are just
looking for somebody

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
who has their back and is
fighting for them every day.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.993 size:81% position:41%
Wisconsin's number one
in cheese production.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:43.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
Almost a quarter of all
the cheese in the country.

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:44.531 line:92%
We're America's dairy land.

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:46.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
We also have a huge
manufacturing sector.

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:49.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
So you know us for
beer and brats and cheese,

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:52.906 size:88% position:44%
but you also know us for
motorcycles and bicycles

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:54.374 line:92%
and you know us for ships.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:55.742 line:92%
We make ships for the Navy.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:57.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know us
for all sorts of things.

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:03.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
And fighting for those things
that identify us

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:05.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
as Wisconsinites
and our work ethic

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:07.654 line:92%
and those cultural traditions,

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:11.391
I think that's what's really
important to voters in my state.

00:03:11.391 --> 00:03:12.392 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Well, that's fantastic.

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:14.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just a real pleasure
to meet you.

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:18.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, cheers.
-But we can shake too.

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.234
-Yeah, we'll shake too. Senator
Tammy Baldwin, everybody.

